Package: ferroptosisDefence
Title: Reproducibility Materials for the Ferroptosis Defence Manuscript
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Huan", "Ryan", email = "huanryan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analysis code, derived data and figure production for a pan-cancer
    study of cell-intrinsic ferroptosis defence. Regenerates every number and
    figure in the manuscript from committed derived objects, and re-derives those
    objects from the original DepMap, CTRP, Cell Model Passports and TCGA sources
    when data/raw/ has been populated by data/download.R. Not an installable
    package: this file exists to pin the dependency set. Exact versions are in
    renv.lock and docs/package_versions.csv.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
